  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.4.1 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Other Changes\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.48.0 to 1.48.1 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/56\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.48.1 to 1.48.2 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/58\n* chore(deps): bump dependabot/fetch-metadata from 2 to 3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/57\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.48.2 to 1.49.1 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/59\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.49.1 to 1.50.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/60\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/tidwall/gjson from 1.18.0 to 1.19.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/61\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.50.0 to 1.50.1 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/62\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.50.1 to 1.51.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/63\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.51.0 to 1.52.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/64\n* chore(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/65\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.52.0 to 1.53.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/66\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/compare/v0.4.0...v0.4.1\n\n",
